# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is PUBLIC (or about to be). Only the website
# belongs here. Everything else lives in the private source
# repository and is never copied across.
#
# Deliberately not a copy of the source repo's .gitignore.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# All markdown except this repository's own README.
# Fails closed: any document that lands here is ignored by default.
*.md
!README.md

# Local tooling.
.claude/

# Archives.
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz

# OS and editor cruft.
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
